Subject: [PATCH 18/30] portal: in-place rnsd update (pip) + pip/setuptools on
 the rootfs

Builds on the update-check notifier with an actual in-place update, since the
rootfs is writeable and rns is a pure-Python wheel. updatecheck.apply_update()
installs the latest rns wheel with pip (--no-deps --only-binary, so the
compiled deps cryptography/pyserial are never rebuilt), first clearing the old
buildroot (distutils) install that pip cannot uninstall, keeping a rollback
tarball, and restarting + verifying rnsd -- rolling back automatically if rnsd
does not come back. Only site-packages is touched; /etc and user config are
never modified. A dependency pre-check refuses the update (pointing at a
reflash) if the new rns needs a newer cryptography/pyserial than is installed.
(pip 22.3.1 on the target predates --break-system-packages, and buildroot's
rootfs is not PEP-668 externally-managed, so no such flag is used.)

The Reticulum tab gains an "Update rnsd to X now" button (with a confirm) when
an update is available, via a new /reticulum/applyupdate route. Enables
python-pip + python-setuptools in the defconfig so pip is on the box for this
and for general package management.
---
 buildroot/configs/cvitek_SG200X_musl_riscv64_defconfig | 9 ++++++---
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/buildroot/configs/cvitek_SG200X_musl_riscv64_defconfig b/buildroot/configs/cvitek_SG200X_musl_riscv64_defconfig
index 4929dcf3e..fdbd49452 100644
--- a/buildroot/configs/cvitek_SG200X_musl_riscv64_defconfig
+++ b/buildroot/configs/cvitek_SG200X_musl_riscv64_defconfig
@@ -1397,7 +1397,7 @@ BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_BZIP2=y
 BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_SSL=y
 # BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_UNICODEDATA is not set
 # BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_SQLITE is not set
-# BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_PYEXPAT is not set
+BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_PYEXPAT=y
 # BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_XZ is not set
 BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_ZLIB=y
 
@@ -1648,7 +1648,10 @@ BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_ZLIB=y
 # BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON_PIEXIF is not set
 # BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON_PIGPIO is not set
 # BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON_PILLOW is not set
-# BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON_PIP is not set
+# RNSBox: pip + setuptools on the (writeable) rootfs so rnsd can be updated in
+# place from its PyPI wheel (the portal's "Update rnsd" button), and for general
+# on-device package management.
+BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON_PIP=y
 # BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON_PLUGGY is not set
 # BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON_PLY is not set
 # BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON_PORTEND is not set
@@ -1755,7 +1758,7 @@ BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_ZLIB=y
 BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON_SERIAL=y
 # BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON_SERIAL_ASYNCIO is not set
 # BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON_SETPROCTITLE is not set
-# BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON_SETUPTOOLS is not set
+BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON_SETUPTOOLS=y
 # BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON_SH is not set
 # BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON_SHUTILWHICH is not set
 # BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON_SIMPLEAUDIO is not set
